# Open Brain

OpenAI 兼容 API，回复由人在控制台手工完成。任何走 Chat Completions / Completions 的客户端都能接，操作员打开网页当模型。

## 启动

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
python -m open_brain --port 8000
```

- 操作员控制台: http://127.0.0.1:8000/
- OpenAI Base URL: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1`

## 客户端

任意 OpenAI SDK，把 `base_url` 指过来即可。API Key 默认不校验；若设置了 `OPEN_BRAIN_API_KEY`，请求需带 `Authorization: Bearer ...`。

```python
from openai import OpenAI

client = OpenAI(base_url="http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1", api_key="sk-any")
print(client.chat.completions.create(
    model="human",
    messages=[{"role": "user", "content": "你好"}],
).choices[0].message.content)
```

```bash
curl http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions \
  -H "content-type: application/json" \
  -d '{"model":"human","messages":[{"role":"user","content":"hi"}]}'
```

请求会一直挂起，直到控制台点「发送回复」。`stream: true` 时，人工写完后按块以 SSE 推给客户端。

## 环境变量

| 变量 | 含义 | 默认 |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `OPEN_BRAIN_HOST` | 监听地址 | `0.0.0.0` |
| `OPEN_BRAIN_PORT` | 端口 | `8000` |
| `OPEN_BRAIN_MODEL` | `/v1/models` 里排第一的模型名 | `human` |
| `OPEN_BRAIN_API_KEY` | 非空则校验 Bearer | 空（不校验） |
| `OPEN_BRAIN_WAIT_TIMEOUT` | 等人回复的秒数 | `21600` |

兼容接口：`GET /v1/models`、`POST /v1/chat/completions`、`POST /v1/completions`，含非流式和 SSE。
